  "text": "Why the US stock market crashed on Thursday, 5 November 2026, and whether it was the AI bubble popping.\n\nOn Thursday the S&P 500 fell more than 4%, the Dow lost 1,833 points and Nvidia dropped 9%, losing more than $400 billion in a single morning. The sell-off followed a midterm election in which voters turned against AI data centres, a report that 600,000 Nvidia chips were stuck in Hong Kong, and big funds selling the year's winners to lock in their gains. It came after a month in which AI stocks had already lost about $5 trillion.\n\nOfficial partner: Overnight Studio, the studio behind this channel’s videos. Make your own: madeovernight.com\n\nWould you have bought the dip?\n\n0:00 The $400 billion morning\n0:48 The Top\n1:57 The Cracks\n5:01 The Midterms\n6:48 The One-Day Party\n8:09 Thursday\n10:59 Who Gets Hurt\n12:02 Did the Bubble Pop?\n\nA lot of people have been asking how we make these videos. For inquiries into our process you can send us an email on: overnightstudiosi@gmail.com\n\nFigures as of 6 November 2026, from reporting by CNBC, Yahoo Finance, Reuters and NBC News.",
